    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f51cb280013f5ab11b621555",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……不对。对方可是黄金船，\n说不定真的只是为了这个……？\n如果是这样，那她还真是个捣蛋鬼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb785f0d83c35a4a6491f5f5f985f1b4000bbb8901d0880290a294f7bce28c23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
