    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:090af32ef744744bb8f00ddd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好吧，如果她只是想稍微玩一下……\n不对，这样好吗？太顺着她的意似乎也……\n唔嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8add111d705e262a66d85f867e1bb5d0cf3a6e2e72e7a8916133f2b45e5999c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
