      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，我也不想因此而妨碍目白麦昆的训练。\n于是，我向她提议进行游戏性质的共同训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00970ee759a56855a79f3390e7c5227d9852cd3614e5a8c246224eff5221d9db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
