    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ea1e11dacd10b441eaa1de3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──于是，在目白麦昆的陪伴下，\n黄金船大玩特玩了一番，\n看起来相当满足。",
      "source_fingerprint": "707a3b4cae0f4e3ba76a9ab778286edcf0e80bcc0b2cf6adbbea122ee7c87fac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
