      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……但是，要这么做的话，\n就必须有人承受她的挫折。\n这个任务……只有我能扛下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18722ba774c89b299847e62f0f9ab3ad8dd766e56d433e405576cab7110c2c8b",
